"the message was altered by a third party. "
"<p> The receiver can obtain your certificate from a central server, but you can "
"also opt to enclose your certificate with your message. You can select whether "
"you do not want to include a certificate at all, only your own certificate or "
"the whole chain of certificates that certify your own certificate, including or "
"excluding the root certificate. "
